# The transient notice, arriving and leaving.
#
# It used to be accent text on the footer's second line, sharing that row with the link
# summary. It is a container of its own now - the theme's inverted surface, sized to its own
# words - that slides up from below the panel and slides back down when it times out. Both
# halves of that are why this is a clip and not a screenshot: a notice that appears in place
# has to be noticed before it can be read, and movement is what does the noticing.
#
# The footer underneath it keeps saying what the radio is doing throughout, which is the other
# half of the change: the two facts no longer take turns on one row.
scene demo
scale 4
delay 130

hold 500
key down 4
key a
hold 600
# A short one: the bar is sized to its text, not to the panel.
toast Sent to BRVO
hold 1400
# Four seconds after it was raised the nav drops it, and the frame after that films it leave.
hold 3000
frame
hold 800
# A second notice arriving while the first has gone: it enters from below rather than appearing.
toast Not connected
hold 1400
hold 3000
frame
hold 900
